  "releaseNotes": "10.1.1\n\n* Fixed: SFtpClient.Exists and ExistsAsync threw SftpPathNotFoundException for a missing path\n  instead of returning false. They went through GetFileInfo, which throws when the path is not\n  there. They now do the same check as Exist and ExistAsync, which were already correct.\n\nUpgrading from 10.0.x or 2.x? 10.1.0 merged the netstandard2.0 and net8.0+ packages into one and\nraised the dependency floors (including SSH.NET 2026.0.0). Its notes list every change:\nhttps://www.nuget.org/packages/Com.H.Net.Ssh/10.1.0#releasenotes-body-tab",
